    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Wuhu Island",
    "description": "Get a bird's-eye view of Wuhu Island. This is a 3D live scene featuring a Mii pilot flying around the island setting of games like Wii Sports Resort and Wii Fit Plus.\n\nThe chosen Mii (or Mii-related character) is randomized at startup, but you can also specify the one you want to use. The color of the plane can also be customized along with the colors of the jetpack Miis. You can also adjust the time of day or let it change on its own in real time. \n\nThere are additional settings related to the camera, clock, and sound. You can control the Manual camera option by clicking and dragging your mouse across the desktop.\n\n--Resource Rippers--\nCentrixe the Dodo | SlashterYT | Tens | Orange Pumpkin | Mystie | SpaceCats | Random Talking Bush | Chaofanatic | lelumini | Hallow | Mii Library\n\nVHS Date and Time by rootkitwolf.\nManual camera (3D Camera) by Gariam.\nSimple Audio Bars visualizer by OMGParticles.",
